         "label": "PL - Rich Text",
         "name": "module_1",
         "params": {
          "align": "left",
          "body_size": 18,
          "content": "<h2>Why brands choose capsules as a supplement format.</h2><p>Different audiences prefer different delivery formats. Capsules are a category-leading choice when your customers want a specific combination of convenience, dosing precision, and ingredient compatibility.</p><p>With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can quickly build a capsules-based product line that fits your audience. Below is what to know about manufacturing capsules for private label: the formulations we offer, the specs available, how we make them, and which health categories benefit most.</p>",
          "max_width": 850,
          "module_id": 218940115784,
          "section_id": "",
          "size": "normal",
          "style": {
           "background_color": {
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "opacity": 100
           },
           "padding": {
            "padding_bottom": 50,
            "padding_top": 80
           }
          },
