      "rows": [
       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "PL - Card Grid",
         "name": "module_3",
         "params": {
          "accent_color": {
           "color": "#6BA644",
           "opacity": 100
          },
          "card_align": "left",
          "card_style": "card",
          "cards": [
           {
            "content": "<p>Capsules are the most recognized supplement format. Customers swallow them whole, dosing is precise, and the format works across nearly every health category. The right choice when your audience prefers a familiar, low-friction supplement experience.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-ae9b4a4f61.svg"
            },
            "title": "The standard for no-fuss supplement delivery"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p>Choose hard-shell gelatin for traditional formulations or HPMC vegetarian capsules for plant-based, kosher, and halal-compatible positioning. Both deliver the same dosing precision and stability.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-0e742f57f3.svg"
            },
            "title": "Vegetarian and gelatin options"
           },
           {
            "content": "<p>Capsules accommodate powders, oils, herbs, and combination formulas that would not work in tablet form. The strongest choice for complex multi-ingredient products and sensitive actives.</p>",
            "icon": {
             "alt": "",
             "loading": "lazy",
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/icons/pl-icon-ad898d8cf3.svg"
            },
            "title": "Wide ingredient compatibility"
           }
          ],
          "eyebrow_style": "text",
          "gap": 28,
          "icon_badge": true,
