         "name": "module_6",
         "params": {
          "buttons": [],
          "content": "<p>Our encapsulation lines run in our FDA-registered Vermont facility under full GMP controls. Every batch goes through identity verification on raw materials, in-process fill weight checks, and finished-product testing for identity, purity, potency, and contaminants before release. Bottling, induction sealing, and labeling happen on the same site, so your private label product ships customer-ready without a third-party packaging handoff.</p>",
